cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the associated study and record the software commit or archived
  release used. The preferred citation DOI identifies the preprint, not software.
type: software
title: "Wild Boar Habitat Suitability Modelling for France"
abstract: >-
  Code-only Python workflows for seasonal presence-background habitat suitability
  modelling of Sus scrofa in mainland France, comparing multitemporal and
  training-year-averaged MaxEnt and LightGBM models with leave-one-year-out
  evaluation, bias-aware background sampling and environmental diagnostics.
authors:
  - family-names: Meyer
    given-names: Adrian Ferdinand
