url: "https://github.com/waldstrom/wildboar-france-multitemp-sdm"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - Sus scrofa
  - species distribution modelling
  - habitat suitability
  - France
  - MaxEnt
  - LightGBM
  - remote sensing
  - multitemporal modelling
  - leave-one-year-out validation
  - wildlife-vehicle collisions
